  "question": {
    "text": "The magnifying power of a telescope is $9 .$ When it is adjusted for parallel rays, the distance between the objective and the eye piece is found to be $20 \\mathrm{~cm}$. The focal length of lenses are",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "qjN2Q",
      "text": "$18 \\mathrm{~cm}, 2 \\mathrm{~cm}$",
      "isCorrect": true,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "CSPOT",
      "text": "$11 \\mathrm{~cm}, 9 \\mathrm{~cm}$",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "W0xt9",
      "text": "$10 \\mathrm{~cm}, 10 \\mathrm{~cm}$",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "agQjf",
      "text": "$15 \\mathrm{~cm}, 5 \\mathrm{~cm}$",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\frac{\\mathrm{f}_{0}}{\\mathrm{f}_{\\mathrm{e}}}=9, \\quad \\therefore \\mathrm{f}_{0}=9 \\mathrm{f}_{\\mathrm{e}}$\r\n\r\nAlso $\\mathrm{f}_{0}+\\mathrm{f}_{\\mathrm{e}}=20(\\because$ final image is at infinity $)$ $9 \\mathrm{f}_{\\mathrm{e}}+\\mathrm{f}_{\\mathrm{e}}=20, \\mathrm{f}_{\\mathrm{e}}=2 \\mathrm{~cm}, \\quad \\therefore \\mathrm{f}_{0}=18 \\mathrm{~cm}$",
